    "duration": 3,
    "text": "未來將以中階技術人力身份引進",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1297.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "包括旅宿業、港口碼頭裝卸",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1299.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "引進外籍勞動力",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1301.4,
    "duration": 16,
    "text": "洪聲翰指出勞動力政策調整",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1317.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "是以幫本勞加薪",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1319.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "作為增加聘僱移工人力的要件",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1321.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "希望藉此提高本勞薪資",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1323.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "外傳企業每新聘一名外籍移工",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1326.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "將以比例為最低薪資的本級勞工每月加薪2000元",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1354.4,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "卓榮泰強調行政府會30號將通過這項方案",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1360.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也會公佈相關配套",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1362.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "期盼產業界對於本國勞工必須共享資源",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1365.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "給予更多照顧提升勞工薪資結構",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1368.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "讓本國勞工得到更多的福利跟權益照顧",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1371.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "公視新聞賴淑敏講龍鄉",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1373.4,
    "duration": 10,
    "text": "美國密西西比州發生一起實驗室猴子逃脫的事件",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1383.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "載送猴群卡車翻覆大部分喪命",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1387.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "清點後確認還有三隻在逃",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1391.4,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "警方原先警告猴子帶有新冠等病毒",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1396.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "不過研究單位隨後更新了",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1400.4,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "他們沒有接觸任何傳染源也不具傳染性",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1405.4,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "這隻猴子待在草叢間東張西望",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1410.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "原本被關在大卡車內的木箱",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1412.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "現在突然身處野外",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1414.4,
    "duration": 14,
    "text": "警方表示最初判斷除了一隻猴子",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1428.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "其餘逃脫的都已沒命",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1430.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "但隨後更新聲明經過清點後確認有三隻在逃",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1434.4,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "這是一起車禍現場",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1446.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "大卡車翻覆車內的木箱散落多處",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1449.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "上面貼有活體動物的標籤",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1451.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "逃脫的動物是橫河猴",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1453.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一般來說他們的體重大約是7公斤",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1456.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "是全球在醫學研究用途上最多的動物之一",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1459.4,
    "duration": 22,
    "text": "警方最初接獲通報",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1481.4,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "表示卡車司機說這些猴子具危險性要處理得穿戴防護裝備",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1486.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "因此在車禍發生後第一時間新聞報道",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1489.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "猴子身上有包括C肝 新冠在內等病毒",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1492.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "杜蘭大學澄清猴子並未接觸任何傳染性病原體",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1496.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "至於車上原本載了多少猴子",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1498.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "猴子的所有權人是誰",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1500.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "運送目的地 誰負責運送",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1502.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "以及卡車翻覆的原因尚待釐清",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1505.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "公視新聞黃韻玲編譯",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1509.4,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "關心天氣 今晚到週五東北季風增強",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1515.4,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "北部還有宜蘭地區有局部短暫雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1520.4,
    "duration": 7,
    "text": "另外華東以及恆春半島有零星短暫雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1527.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "接著就提供給您各地的氣象資料",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 1540.4,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "MING PAO CANADA | MING PAO TORONTO",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1570.4,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "感謝您收看這一節的公視手語新聞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1574.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "我是王小舒",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1576.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "明天同一時間再會",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1599.4,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "MING PAO CANADA | MING PAO TORONTO",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  }
]